#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Parameters to set when provisioning a Qiskit Runtime service instance, and "
"extension fields returned when accessing an instance."
msgstr ""
"Mga parameter na itatatakda kapag nagpo-provision ng Qiskit Runtime service "
"instance, at mga extension field na ibinabalik kapag ina-access ang isang "
"instance."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use IBM Cloud Platform APIs to access instances"
msgstr "Gamitin ang IBM Cloud Platform APIs para ma-access ang mga instance"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore ResourceController  */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore ResourceController  */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use IBM Cloud Platform APIs to access instances {#use-ibm-cloud-platform-"
"apis-to-access-instances}"
msgstr ""
"Gamitin ang IBM Cloud Platform APIs para ma-access ang mga instance {#use-"
"ibm-cloud-platform-apis-to-access-instances}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This guide is for anyone using the IBM Cloud Platform APIs to provision, "
"update, or manage access to instances. It provides details on the "
"[parameters](#parameters) you can set when provisioning an instance, as well"
" as the set of [extension fields](#extensions) returned when you access an "
"instance.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang gabay na ito ay para sa sinumang gumagamit ng IBM Cloud Platform APIs "
"para mag-provision, mag-update, o pamahalaan ang access sa mga instance. "
"Ibinibigay nito ang mga detalye ng [mga parameter](#parameters) na maaari "
"mong itakda kapag nagpo-provision ng instance, pati na rin ang hanay ng [mga"
" extension field](#extensions) na ibinabalik kapag ina-access mo ang isang "
"instance.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Refer to the IBM Cloud&reg; ResourceController API documentation for more information.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Tingnan ang dokumentasyon ng IBM Cloud&reg; ResourceController API para sa karagdagang impormasyon.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Some relevant pages:\n"
"- [Create (provision) a new resource instance](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#create-resource-instance)\n"
"- [Update a resource instance](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#update-resource-instance)\n"
"- [Get a resource instance](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#get-resource-instance)\n"
"- [Get a list of all resource instances](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#list-resource-instances)  \n"
msgstr ""
"Ilang mga kaugnay na pahina:\n"
"- [Gumawa (mag-provision) ng bagong resource instance](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#create-resource-instance)\n"
"- [I-update ang isang resource instance](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#update-resource-instance)\n"
"- [Kunin ang isang resource instance](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#get-resource-instance)\n"
"- [Kunin ang listahan ng lahat ng resource instance](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#list-resource-instances)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When getting a list of all resource instances, note that you can filter to "
"only Qiskit Runtime instances with `resource_id = "
"\"b6049020-80f4-11eb-a0f7-e35ec9b4054f\"`\n"
msgstr ""
"    Kapag kinukuha ang listahan ng lahat ng resource instance, tandaan na "
"maaari kang mag-filter para makita lang ang mga Qiskit Runtime instance "
"gamit ang `resource_id = \"b6049020-80f4-11eb-a0f7-e35ec9b4054f\"`\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "</Admonition>\n"
msgstr "</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "`parameters` {#parameters}"
msgstr "`parameters` {#parameters}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "In the body when provisioning or updating an instance:\n"
msgstr "Sa body kapag nagpo-provision o nag-a-update ng instance:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- **instance_limit_seconds** (string or null, `^[0-9]+$`): The limit to set on the instance. For Open Plan: if omitted, this defaults to 10 minutes.\n"
".\n"
"- **usage_allocation_seconds** (string or null, `^[0-9]+$`): Allotted time for the instance, used by the fair-share scheduler to determine the priority in the queue, based on usage of all QPUs. (This does not apply to Pay-As-You-Go instances.)\n"
"- **backends** (array of lists of backends (strings or null) or array with \"ANY\"): the allow-list of names of backends that are available to this instance. Default: `[\"ANY\"]`, means all backends available on this plan. `[]` means no backends.\n"
msgstr ""
"- **instance_limit_seconds** (string o null, `^[0-9]+$`): Ang limitasyon na itatakda sa instance. Para sa Open Plan: kung hindi tinukoy, ang default nito ay 10 minuto.\n"
".\n"
"- **usage_allocation_seconds** (string o null, `^[0-9]+$`): Inilaan na oras para sa instance, ginagamit ng fair-share scheduler para matukoy ang priyoridad sa pila, batay sa paggamit ng lahat ng QPU. (Hindi ito naaangkop sa mga Pay-As-You-Go instance.)\n"
"- **backends** (array ng mga listahan ng backends (strings o null) o array na may \"ANY\"): ang allow-list ng mga pangalan ng backends na available sa instance na ito. Default: `[\"ANY\"]`, ibig sabihin lahat ng backends na available sa planong ito. `[]` ibig sabihin walang backends.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "`extensions` {#extensions}"
msgstr "`extensions` {#extensions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In the response when provisioning or when getting the details of an "
"instance:\n"
msgstr ""
"Sa response kapag nagpo-provision o kapag kinukuha ang mga detalye ng "
"instance:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Additional instance properties contributed by the service that are "
"represented as key-value pairs. These properties persist with the instance "
"under the extensions property.\n"
msgstr ""
"Mga karagdagang katangian ng instance na ibinibigay ng serbisyo at "
"kinakatawan bilang mga key-value pair. Ang mga katangiang ito ay nananatili "
"sa instance sa ilalim ng extensions property.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**instance_limit_seconds** (integer or null, `>= 0`): The time limit to set "
"on the instance.\n"
msgstr ""
"**instance_limit_seconds** (integer o null, `>= 0`): Ang limitasyon sa oras "
"na itatakda sa instance.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**usage_allocation_seconds** (integer or null, `>= 0`): Allotted time for "
"the instance, used by the fair-share scheduler to determine the priority in "
"the queue, based on usage of all QPUs.\n"
msgstr ""
"**usage_allocation_seconds** (integer o null, `>= 0`): Inilaan na oras para "
"sa instance, ginagamit ng fair-share scheduler para matukoy ang priyoridad "
"sa pila, batay sa paggamit ng lahat ng QPU.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**backends** (Required; array of lists of backends (strings) or array with "
"\"ANY\" (strings)): The allow-list of names of backends that are available "
"to this instance. Default: `[\"ANY\"]`, means all backends are available on "
"this plan. `[]` means no backends.\n"
msgstr ""
"**backends** (Kinakailangan; array ng mga listahan ng backends (strings) o "
"array na may \"ANY\" (strings)): Ang allow-list ng mga pangalan ng backends "
"na available sa instance na ito. Default: `[\"ANY\"]`, ibig sabihin lahat ng"
" backends ay available sa planong ito. `[]` ibig sabihin walang backends.\n"
